sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Human Participant
    participant LK as LiveKit Room
    participant STT as STT Engine
    participant Router as Bot Router
    participant Turn as Turn Manager
    participant LLM as OpenAI GPT-4o
    participant TTS as TTS Engine

    User->>LK: Spoken Voice / Text Chat
    LK->>STT: Raw Audio Stream
    STT-->>Router: Transcribed Text & Speaker Identity
    Router->>Router: Evaluate Bot Selection & Intent
    Router->>Turn: Acquire Lock (IDLE -> THINKING)
    Turn-->>Router: Lock Granted
    Router->>LLM: Prompt System & Conversation History
    LLM-->>Router: Synthesized Response Text
    Turn->>Turn: Update State (SPEAKING)
    Router->>TTS: Stream Text to Audio
    TTS-->>LK: Publish Audio Track
    LK-->>User: Playback Audio & UI Update
    Turn->>Turn: Release Lock (IDLE)
